  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Togo Extractive Industries Transparency Initiative Implementation Support Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective is to support implementation and sustainability of the Extractive Industries Transparency Initiative in Togo. This will be achieved through improved reporting procedures for production and revenue data from the extractive industries, strategic communication with stakeholders as well as business planning for the EITI Secretariat.</narrative>
  </description>
